  "person_4": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello, I'm Dr Reyes. What would you like me to call you, Mr Tran, or Henry? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Henry's fine. My legs are a bit puffy, that's all, but Marisol made me come."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'm his carer, Marisol, I live in. His ankles have been swollen for three weeks, and last night he couldn't lie down, he slept in the chair."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks, no. One week. It's been one week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "One week or three weeks. We'll record that as somewhere between one and three weeks. And last night, Henry?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Couldn't breathe lying flat. I had to prop up on three pillows, then the chair."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Nurse, can we get his obs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Sure. Oxygen 92 percent, blood pressure 156 over 92, pulse 96, breathing 22, temperature 36.8, and weight 88 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Henry, what medications do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Metoprolol, 50 mg, twice a day. And a little white water pill, I take it every morning. I couldn't tell you the name."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll bring the box tomorrow, doctor. It's small and white, but I've not got the name written down."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine, we'll find it on the pharmacy record. Any heart history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure, for thirty years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Bypass surgery, in 2016."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who looks after you at home?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I do, I live in with him."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look at your legs. Press here.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Cold hands, doc. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's pitting swelling in both legs, up to the knees."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "It wasn't that high yesterday. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any palpitations, fluttering in the chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I'm seeing looks like fluid backing up, probably from the heart, but let's confirm."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It needs treatment today. I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray, an ECG, and blood tests including a heart-strain marker."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll take him for the ECG now. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, nurse. If the swelling isn't coming down after three days of the treatment, come straight back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll watch his legs. ~"
  }
